{% doc %}
  @prompt
    Create a Shopify section called "Brand Directory" that displays all store vendors as a filterable, alphabetical brand logo grid.
    Layout & Structure:
    
    Full-width section with a large bold heading ("All Brands" or customizable via settings)
    Below the heading, a horizontal alphabet filter bar with individual letter buttons (#, A–Z) plus an "All" button at the start
    The active/selected letter should be visually highlighted (filled background or underline style)
    Below the filter bar, brand logos are displayed in a responsive CSS grid (6 columns desktop, 3–4 tablet, 2 mobile)
    Each brand logo is a clickable link that routes to /collections/vendors?q=[vendor name] or a customizable URL per brand
    
    Brand Data & Logo Display:
    
    Brands are defined as a repeatable block in section settings, each block containing: Brand Name (text), Logo Image (image picker), and optional Custom URL (URL field)
    If no logo image is uploaded for a brand, fall back to displaying the brand name as styled text
    Logos displayed in black and white / greyscale by default, with full colour or opacity change on hover (customizable)
    Maintain consistent logo cell size with logos scaled to fit (object-fit: contain) within a fixed-height container
    
    Alphabet Filter Behaviour:
    
    Implemented in vanilla JavaScript (no external libraries) — no page reload required
    Clicking a letter hides all brand grid items whose names do not start with that letter
    Clicking "All" shows every brand
    If a selected letter has no matching brands, display a subtle "No brands found" message
    Brands are sorted alphabetically by name automatically on render
    The "#" filter shows brands starting with a number
    
    Theme Integration & Customization Settings:
    
    Section padding (top/bottom) — defaults to theme spacing
    Background color — defaults to theme background
    Heading text, font size, and alignment — inherits theme heading styles by default
    Filter bar: button font, active state color, inactive state color — all default to theme accent/primary colors
    Logo cell border: toggle on/off, color, border-radius — defaults off
    Logo hover effect: choose between colour reveal, opacity lift, or none
    Grid gap size — small / medium / large options
    Section max-width — full width or contained
    
    Code Requirements:
    
    Written as a single .liquid file with embedded <style> and <script> blocks
    Uses Shopify section schema at the bottom with all settings and one repeatable block type ("Brand")
    Semantic HTML: section > div.container > h2 + nav (filter bar) + div (grid)
    Mobile responsive using CSS grid auto-fill or explicit column counts per breakpoint via media queries
    No dependencies on jQuery or external scripts
    Compatible with Shopify OS 2.0 themes, Restyle the alphabet filter bar to match the following:
    
    Remove the individual button box/border from each letter — letters should sit in a plain horizontal row with no background or box by default
    Add a single full-width border line underneath the entire row of letters (like a bottom border on the nav container, not on each individual letter)
    On hover, each letter should show a filled background (theme accent/primary color) so it feels like a button only on interaction
    The active/selected letter should also have the filled background state
    All letters must fit in a single row on desktop — reduce font size, letter-spacing, or padding as needed to prevent wrapping. Do not allow overflow into a second row on desktop
    On mobile: collapse the alphabet filter into a compact dropdown select element (a styled <select> tag) that shows the currently active letter and allows the user to pick a different one. Style it to match the section's color settings.
    Also add a top border to the filter bar container as well, so the row of letters sits between a top and bottom border line — both spanning the full width of the section/container. The border color should be a customizable setting that defaults to the theme's border or text color., Change the grid to display 5 columns on desktop, 3 on tablet, and 2 on mobile. Increase the padding inside each logo cell to give logos more breathing room., Remove the custom URL field from the brand block settings entirely. Instead, always auto-generate the vendor link from the brand name using the format /collections/vendors?q=[brand name], encoding any spaces as %20. No manual URL input should be required.
{% enddoc %}
{% assign ai_gen_id = block.id | replace: '_', '' | downcase %}

{% style %}
  .ai-brand-directory-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    padding-top: {{ block.settings.padding_top }}px;
    padding-bottom: {{ block.settings.padding_bottom }}px;
    background-color: {{ block.settings.background_color }};
  }

  .ai-brand-directory-container-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    {% if block.settings.max_width == 'full' %}
      max-width: 100%;
      padding-left: 20px;
      padding-right: 20px;
    {% else %}
      max-width: 1200px;
      margin-left: auto;
      margin-right: auto;
      padding-left: 20px;
      padding-right: 20px;
    {% endif %}
  }

  .ai-brand-directory-heading-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: {{ block.settings.heading_size }}px;
    text-align: {{ block.settings.heading_alignment }};
    margin: 0 0 40px 0;
    color: {{ block.settings.heading_color }};
  }

  .ai-brand-directory-filter-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: nowrap;
    gap: 4px;
    justify-content: {{ block.settings.heading_alignment }};
    margin-bottom: 40px;
    padding: 12px 0;
    border-top: 1px solid {{ block.settings.filter_border_color }};
    border-bottom: 1px solid {{ block.settings.filter_border_color }};
    overflow-x: auto;
  }

  .ai-brand-directory-filter-select-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: none;
    width: 100%;
    padding: 12px 16px;
    margin-bottom: 40px;
    background-color: {{ block.settings.filter_inactive_bg }};
    color: {{ block.settings.filter_inactive_color }};
    border: 1px solid {{ block.settings.filter_border_color }};
    border-radius: 0;
    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: 600;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    cursor: pointer;
  }

  .ai-brand-directory-filter-btn-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    padding: 6px 8px;
    background-color: transparent;
    color: {{ block.settings.filter_inactive_color }};
    border: none;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: all 0.3s ease;
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 600;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    white-space: nowrap;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .ai-brand-directory-filter-btn-{{ ai_gen_id }}:hover {
    background-color: {{ block.settings.filter_active_bg }};
    color: {{ block.settings.filter_active_color }};
  }

  .ai-brand-directory-filter-btn-{{ ai_gen_id }}.active {
    background-color: {{ block.settings.filter_active_bg }};
    color: {{ block.settings.filter_active_color }};
  }

  @media screen and (max-width: 749px) {
    .ai-brand-directory-filter-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      display: none;
    }

    .ai-brand-directory-filter-select-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      display: block;
    }
  }

  .ai-brand-directory-grid-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(5, 1fr);
    gap: {{ block.settings.grid_gap }}px;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }

  @media screen and (max-width: 989px) {
    .ai-brand-directory-grid-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    }
  }

  @media screen and (max-width: 749px) {
    .ai-brand-directory-grid-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    }
  }

  .ai-brand-directory-item-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    padding: 30px;
    background-color: {{ block.settings.logo_cell_bg }};
    {% if block.settings.show_border %}
      border: 1px solid {{ block.settings.border_color }};
    {% endif %}
    border-radius: {{ block.settings.border_radius }}px;
    transition: all 0.3s ease;
    text-decoration: none;
    height: 140px;
  }

  .ai-brand-directory-item-{{ ai_gen_id }}:hover {
    {% if block.settings.hover_effect == 'color' %}
      filter: none;
    {% elsif block.settings.hover_effect == 'opacity' %}
      opacity: 0.7;
    {% endif %}
  }

  .ai-brand-directory-logo-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: contain;
    {% if block.settings.hover_effect == 'color' %}
      filter: grayscale(100%);
      transition: filter 0.3s ease;
    {% endif %}
  }

  .ai-brand-directory-item-{{ ai_gen_id }}:hover .ai-brand-directory-logo-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    {% if block.settings.hover_effect == 'color' %}
      filter: grayscale(0%);
    {% endif %}
  }

  .ai-brand-directory-name-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: 16px;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: {{ block.settings.heading_color }};
    text-align: center;
  }

  .ai-brand-directory-empty-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    text-align: center;
    padding: 40px 20px;
    color: {{ block.settings.heading_color }};
    opacity: 0.6;
    font-size: 16px;
    display: none;
  }

  .ai-brand-directory-empty-{{ ai_gen_id }}.visible {
    display: block;
  }
{% endstyle %}

<brand-directory-{{ ai_gen_id }} class="ai-brand-directory-{{ ai_gen_id }}" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
  <div class="ai-brand-directory-container-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
    {% if block.settings.heading != blank %}
      <h2 class="ai-brand-directory-heading-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.heading }}</h2>
    {% endif %}

    <select class="ai-brand-directory-filter-select-{{ ai_gen_id }}" data-filter-select aria-label="Filter brands by letter">
      <option value="all">All Brands</option>
      <option value="#"># (Numbers)</option>
      {% for i in (65..90) %}
        {% assign letter = i | minus: 65 %}
        {% assign letters = 'ABCDEFGHIJKLMNOPQRSTUVWXYZ' | split: '' %}
        <option value="{{ letters[letter] }}">{{ letters[letter] }}</option>
      {% endfor %}
    </select>

    <nav class="ai-brand-directory-filter-{{ ai_gen_id }}" aria-label="Brand filter">
      <button class="ai-brand-directory-filter-btn-{{ ai_gen_id }} active" data-filter="all">All</button>
      <button class="ai-brand-directory-filter-btn-{{ ai_gen_id }}" data-filter="#">#</button>
      {% for i in (65..90) %}
        {% assign letter = i | minus: 65 %}
        {% assign letters = 'ABCDEFGHIJKLMNOPQRSTUVWXYZ' | split: '' %}
        <button class="ai-brand-directory-filter-btn-{{ ai_gen_id }}" data-filter="{{ letters[letter] }}">{{ letters[letter] }}</button>
      {% endfor %}
    </nav>

    <div class="ai-brand-directory-grid-{{ ai_gen_id }}" data-grid>
      {% liquid
        assign brand_1_name = block.settings.brand_1_name
        assign brand_1_logo = block.settings.brand_1_logo
        
        assign brand_2_name = block.settings.brand_2_name
        assign brand_2_logo = block.settings.brand_2_logo
        
        assign brand_3_name = block.settings.brand_3_name
        assign brand_3_logo = block.settings.brand_3_logo
        
        assign brand_4_name = block.settings.brand_4_name
        assign brand_4_logo = block.settings.brand_4_logo
        
        assign brand_5_name = block.settings.brand_5_name
        assign brand_5_logo = block.settings.brand_5_logo
        
        assign brand_6_name = block.settings.brand_6_name
        assign brand_6_logo = block.settings.brand_6_logo
        
        assign brand_7_name = block.settings.brand_7_name
        assign brand_7_logo = block.settings.brand_7_logo
        
        assign brand_8_name = block.settings.brand_8_name
        assign brand_8_logo = block.settings.brand_8_logo
        
        assign brand_9_name = block.settings.brand_9_name
        assign brand_9_logo = block.settings.brand_9_logo
        
        assign brand_10_name = block.settings.brand_10_name
        assign brand_10_logo = block.settings.brand_10_logo
        
        assign brand_11_name = block.settings.brand_11_name
        assign brand_11_logo = block.settings.brand_11_logo
        
        assign brand_12_name = block.settings.brand_12_name
        assign brand_12_logo = block.settings.brand_12_logo
        
        assign brand_13_name = block.settings.brand_13_name
        assign brand_13_logo = block.settings.brand_13_logo
        
        assign brand_14_name = block.settings.brand_14_name
        assign brand_14_logo = block.settings.brand_14_logo
        
        assign brand_15_name = block.settings.brand_15_name
        assign brand_15_logo = block.settings.brand_15_logo
        
        assign brand_16_name = block.settings.brand_16_name
        assign brand_16_logo = block.settings.brand_16_logo
        
        assign brand_17_name = block.settings.brand_17_name
        assign brand_17_logo = block.settings.brand_17_logo
        
        assign brand_18_name = block.settings.brand_18_name
        assign brand_18_logo = block.settings.brand_18_logo
        
        assign brand_19_name = block.settings.brand_19_name
        assign brand_19_logo = block.settings.brand_19_logo
        
        assign brand_20_name = block.settings.brand_20_name
        assign brand_20_logo = block.settings.brand_20_logo
      %}

      {% for i in (1..20) %}
        {% liquid
          case i
            when 1
              assign brand_name = brand_1_name
              assign brand_logo = brand_1_logo
            when 2
              assign brand_name = brand_2_name
              assign brand_logo = brand_2_logo
            when 3
              assign brand_name = brand_3_name
              assign brand_logo = brand_3_logo
            when 4
              assign brand_name = brand_4_name
              assign brand_logo = brand_4_logo
            when 5
              assign brand_name = brand_5_name
              assign brand_logo = brand_5_logo
            when 6
              assign brand_name = brand_6_name
              assign brand_logo = brand_6_logo
            when 7
              assign brand_name = brand_7_name
              assign brand_logo = brand_7_logo
            when 8
              assign brand_name = brand_8_name
              assign brand_logo = brand_8_logo
            when 9
              assign brand_name = brand_9_name
              assign brand_logo = brand_9_logo
            when 10
              assign brand_name = brand_10_name
              assign brand_logo = brand_10_logo
            when 11
              assign brand_name = brand_11_name
              assign brand_logo = brand_11_logo
            when 12
              assign brand_name = brand_12_name
              assign brand_logo = brand_12_logo
            when 13
              assign brand_name = brand_13_name
              assign brand_logo = brand_13_logo
            when 14
              assign brand_name = brand_14_name
              assign brand_logo = brand_14_logo
            when 15
              assign brand_name = brand_15_name
              assign brand_logo = brand_15_logo
            when 16
              assign brand_name = brand_16_name
              assign brand_logo = brand_16_logo
            when 17
              assign brand_name = brand_17_name
              assign brand_logo = brand_17_logo
            when 18
              assign brand_name = brand_18_name
              assign brand_logo = brand_18_logo
            when 19
              assign brand_name = brand_19_name
              assign brand_logo = brand_19_logo
            when 20
              assign brand_name = brand_20_name
              assign brand_logo = brand_20_logo
          endcase
        %}
        
        {% if brand_name != blank %}
          {% assign first_char = brand_name | slice: 0 | upcase %}
          {% assign encoded_name = brand_name | url_encode %}
          {% assign brand_url = '/collections/vendors?q=' | append: encoded_name %}

          <a 
            href="{{ brand_url }}" 
            class="ai-brand-directory-item-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
            data-brand="{{ brand_name }}"
            data-letter="{{ first_char }}"
          >
            {% if brand_logo != blank %}
              <img 
                src="{{ brand_logo | image_url: width: 300 }}" 
                alt="{{ brand_name | escape }}"
                class="ai-brand-directory-logo-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
                loading="lazy"
                width="300"
                height="140"
              >
            {% else %}
              <div class="ai-brand-directory-name-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ brand_name }}</div>
            {% endif %}
          </a>
        {% endif %}
      {% endfor %}
    </div>

    <div class="ai-brand-directory-empty-{{ ai_gen_id }}" data-empty>
      No brands found
    </div>
  </div>
</brand-directory-{{ ai_gen_id }}>

<script>
  (function() {
    class BrandDirectory{{ ai_gen_id }} extends HTMLElement {
      constructor() {
        super();
      }

      connectedCallback() {
        this.filterButtons = this.querySelectorAll('.ai-brand-directory-filter-btn-{{ ai_gen_id }}');
        this.filterSelect = this.querySelector('[data-filter-select]');
        this.brandItems = this.querySelectorAll('.ai-brand-directory-item-{{ ai_gen_id }}');
        this.emptyMessage = this.querySelector('.ai-brand-directory-empty-{{ ai_gen_id }}');
        
        this.sortBrands();
        this.setupEventListeners();
      }

      sortBrands() {
        const grid = this.querySelector('[data-grid]');
        const items = Array.from(this.brandItems);
        
        items.sort(function(a, b) {
          const nameA = a.getAttribute('data-brand').toLowerCase();
          const nameB = b.getAttribute('data-brand').toLowerCase();
          return nameA.localeCompare(nameB);
        });
        
        items.forEach(function(item) {
          grid.appendChild(item);
        });
      }

      setupEventListeners() {
        const self = this;
        
        this.filterButtons.forEach(function(button) {
          button.addEventListener('click', function() {
            const filter = this.getAttribute('data-filter');
            self.filterBrands(filter);
            
            self.filterButtons.forEach(function(btn) {
              btn.classList.remove('active');
            });
            this.classList.add('active');
          });
        });

        if (this.filterSelect) {
          this.filterSelect.addEventListener('change', function() {
            const filter = this.value;
            self.filterBrands(filter);
          });
        }
      }

      filterBrands(filter) {
        let visibleCount = 0;
        
        this.brandItems.forEach(function(item) {
          const brandName = item.getAttribute('data-brand');
          const firstChar = item.getAttribute('data-letter');
          
          if (filter === 'all') {
            item.style.display = 'flex';
            visibleCount++;
          } else if (filter === '#') {
            const isNumber = /^[0-9]/.test(brandName);
            if (isNumber) {
              item.style.display = 'flex';
              visibleCount++;
            } else {
              item.style.display = 'none';
            }
          } else {
            if (firstChar === filter) {
              item.style.display = 'flex';
              visibleCount++;
            } else {
              item.style.display = 'none';
            }
          }
        });
        
        if (visibleCount === 0) {
          this.emptyMessage.classList.add('visible');
        } else {
          this.emptyMessage.classList.remove('visible');
        }
      }
    }

    customElements.define('brand-directory-{{ ai_gen_id }}', BrandDirectory{{ ai_gen_id }});
  })();
</script>

